=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to {p:Ranpi-Monpi|Ranpi-Monpi (S)} in {z:Windurst Waters (S)} for the initial cutscene.
** (Optional) Speak to him again for additional dialogue.
* Go to the present {z:Windurst Waters} and talk to {p:Ranpi-Monpi} for a cutscene.
* You will need to get the following items. They can all be purchased from the {z:Auction House} or gathered / crafted.
** {i:Bastore Sweeper|Bastore Sweeper|5473} - Can be fished up in {z:Vunkerl Inlet (S)}
** {i:Walnut|Walnut|5661} - Can be logged in {z:East Ronfaure (S)}, uncommon.
** {i:Dragon Fruit|Dragon Fruit|5662} - Can be logged in {z:Fort Karugo-Narugo (S)}, common.
** {i:Pepperoni|Pepperoni|5660} - {p:Cooking} synthesis(level 85).
* Trade the above items to Ranpi-Monpi and wait one game day for the dish to be completed.
** (Optional) Speak to him again before the day is up for additional dialogue.
* After receiving {@k} {k:Ranpi-Monpi Specialty} go back to {z:Windurst Waters (S)} and talk to {p:Ranpi-Monpi|Ranpi-Monpi (S)} to feed the young lad. You'll receive a {@k} {k:Culinary knife}.
** (Optional) Speak to him again for some additional dialogue.
* Return this knife to {p:Ranpi-Monpi} in the present and you will get your reward.

=2 Summary
The present-day Ranpi-Monpi will make the dish the Ranpi-Monpi in the past wants. The ingredients are:
* {i:Bastore Sweeper|Bastore Sweeper|5473}
* {i:Walnut|Walnut|5661}
* {i:Dragon Fruit|Dragon Fruit|5662}
* {i:Stick of Pepperoni|Stick of Pepperoni|5660}

